## Rules
Stable IDs; do not renumber. Dependencies are relative filenames and hard prerequisites.
DONE requires scoped acceptance and recorded evidence, not a claim about the whole product.
Maintain docs\06-development-workflow.md and JOURNAL.md with significant changes.
